# whose full module hit a PartialEq Include-clash) because this crate cfg-gates
# its Debug/PartialEq/Eq derives out of extraction — so the whole extracted
# module typechecks. Regenerate with ../extract.sh (re-applies the manual
# patches: loop-shim import + Coq-8.18 binder rewrite + opaque byte<->u32 codecs).

